linagora-lemonldap-ng-plugin-pam-access (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=high

  Requires open-bastion 0.7.0 or later.

  /pam/bastion-token has been removed (it signed a JWT even when the user
  lookup had failed). Its probe mode was the only way for a server to read the
  identity the portal assigned it at enrollment; that is now POST /pam/whoami,
  returning the same bastion_id field with the same value.

  An open-bastion older than 0.7.0 still calls the old endpoint and gets a
  404. What this breaks, and what it does not:

   * ob-bastion-id fails. Bringing a NEW bastion into service therefore fails,
     because its bastion_id is what goes into the backends' allowed_bastions.
     Worse, local-test/deploy-shell.sh and deploy-ansible.sh fall back to the
     literal "ob-bastion" instead of failing, which yields a backend that
     refuses every connection with nothing in the deployment log to say why.
   * Bastions already in service keep working. Connections, sudo and hop
     certificates do not go through this endpoint.

  Also in this release, and NOT yet deployable: pamAccessRequestSigningMode
  must stay at 'off' or 'optional'. The verifier gates all six /pam/*
  endpoints, but the client signs only /pam/verify and /pam/authorize.
  'required' would refuse /pam/heartbeat, which is how every enrolled host
  renews its access token -- nothing fails when you flip the switch, then the
  whole fleet stops at once, hours later, as those tokens expire.

  New, and opt-in on the client side: signed answers (Accept:
  application/ob-pam-response+jwt). Nothing changes until a host asks for
  them. Once hosts REQUIRE them, an answer the portal cannot sign is a 500
  for the whole fleet: keep the PAM relying party without
  oidcRPMetaDataOptionsNoJwtHeader, and rotate the signing key only as the
  README says -- append the new key, wait for every host to receive it
  through the signed heartbeat, move it first, drop the old one later.

  The rest of this release's upgrade notes are in UPGRADING.md upstream:
  https://github.com/linagora/lemonldap-ng-plugins/blob/main/UPGRADING.md

 -- Xavier Guimard <yadd@debian.org>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
